{"at":"2026-10-07T04:14:12.172Z","component":"Account Hub local naming","evidence":["0a3278c4735265634c3c4d96acbfe1671892565cb3a176123c65d8ac620ee5dd","19ddf3a6830ec97d8090eee7288b2b3295ec8d65f6a667e3269fc9f01d55ff32","20e9e3412e486120e89337bfef034978b9eab8caf3eda790ffc9402ace1e92d6","4176ed0842fb6a6c0c461cac7cf9e2dbbf35e9d16b639bc93cae28e81dfcacad","4b15888867cfed890bfe11854ac04083f47932cce645da7e63e0afe57fcdfbbe","5fb90de26a04c86782c454a797ab68fa4ea7c16eb753c5a1cfd5e0d6bdf72483","79c4feb758dd365a8221aa5044d917ddbf3616ebd6bbb2295dc6af933dc4809b","814261e5534dfbad5a12fda4aced92fd000ca272ae85abb50fbd37cdb0bbd812","98c70d0fee39642306ed1a2c42db3404a254d9037df71dd3f6c7b28aaa8d15bd","f62f897a4e5da06c2a47bf11fff1f87876b2f97c64bf54100b7e8a0b36f709f5"],"id":"5a5bc6435aec9fc7222ff735817427b2440b3c8dbba3c51b8c0ae7a5357980f3","kind":"lesson","paths":["mail/components/accountcreation/content/widgets/email-config-found.mjs","mail/components/accountcreation/templates/accountHubEmailConfigFoundTemplate.inc.xhtml","mail/themes/shared/mail/widgets.css"],"quotes":[{"id":"5fb90de26a04c86782c454a797ab68fa4ea7c16eb753c5a1cfd5e0d6bdf72483","text":"            <label id=\"imap\" class=\"config-option\">\n              <div class=\"config-title\">\n                <input type=\"radio\" name=\"config-type\" value=\"imap\" />\n                <span class=\"config-title-text\">IMAP</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\" data-l10n-id=\"account-hub-result-recommended-label\"></span>\n              </div>"},{"id":"0a3278c4735265634c3c4d96acbfe1671892565cb3a176123c65d8ac620ee5dd","text":"              <button id=\"editConfiguration\"\n                      class=\"button link-button link-button-sm\"\n                      type=\"button\"\n                      data-l10n-id=\"account-hub-edit-configuration\">\n              </button>"},{"id":"f62f897a4e5da06c2a47bf11fff1f87876b2f97c64bf54100b7e8a0b36f709f5","text":"      this.querySelector(\"#incomingSocketType\"),\n      incomingSocketTypeL10Id"}],"repository":"thunderbird","source":{"basis":"Quoted evidence supports the claim; its interpretation still needs current-source checks.","revision":"0b93f0f7a926ed94c8a0646f18b6734ec7cc0f6d","sourceAt":"2026-10-05T22:44:59Z","type":"extraction"},"status":"supported","supersedes":[],"text":"In this Account Hub family, CSS classes use readable dash-separated tokens such as config-option and link-button-sm, while controller-addressed DOM IDs use names such as editConfiguration and incomingSocketType. Widget modules use names such as email-config-found.mjs. Follow those local forms when extending the same components, and keep each identifier aligned with its selectors and controller calls. These are observed source patterns and scoped recommendations; the evidence does not justify one naming form for all Thunderbird IDs or files. Full bug and review discussion remains pending.","title":"Account Hub styles distinguish CSS tokens from DOM IDs and module filenames","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
